    Dated Log       Checking legacy counters for DL : M55308C10003
    Check 8940 PM Counters Expected values      ${PRB_AVAIL_PDSCH_LEGACY_Expected}
    Dated Log       Checking legacy counters for UL : M55308C10004
    Check 8940 PM Counters Expected values      ${PRB_AVAIL_PUSCH_LEGACY_Expected}


